enses list outdated prohibits remove require run-script search self-update show suggests status update validate why why-not\0A\0A# Custom scripts\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a '(__fish_composer_scripts)' -d 'User script'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n '__fish_composer_using_command run-script' -a \22(__fish_composer_scripts)\22\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n '__fish_composer_using_command run-script' -l timeout -d 'Sets script timeout in seconds, or 0 for never'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n '__fish_composer_using_command run-script' -l dev -d 'Sets the dev mode'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n '__fish_composer_using_command run-script' -l no-dev -d 'Disables the dev mode'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n '__fish_composer_using_command run-script' -l list -d 'List scripts'\0A\0A# commands\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a about -d 'Short information about Composer'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a archive -d 'Create an archive of this composer package'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a browse -d 'Opens the package\\'s repository URL or homepage in your browser'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a check-platform-reqs -d 'Check that platform requirements are satisfied'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a clear-cache -d 'Clears composer\\'s internal package cache'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a config -d 'Set config options'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a create-project -d 'Create new project from a package into given directory'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a depends -d 'Shows which packages depend on the given package'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a diagnose -d 'Diagnoses the system to identify common errors'\0Acomplete -f -c composer -n __fish_composer_needs_command -a dump-autoload -d 'Dump