les)\22\0Acomplete -c function -s e -l on-event -d \22Make the function a generic event handler\22 -xa \22(__fish_complete_function_event_handlers)\22\0Acomplete -c function -s a -l argument-names -d \22Specify named arguments\22 -x\0Acomplete -c function -s S -l no-scope-shadowing -d \22Do not shadow variable scope of calling function\22\0Acomplete -c function -s w -l wraps -d \22Inherit completions from the given command\22 -xa \22(__fish_complete_command)\22\0Acomplete -c function -s V -l inherit-variable -d \22Snapshot and define local variable\22 -xa \22(__fish_complete_variables)\22\0A", align 1
