edures optimizations\22 \\\\\0A  loop\\t\22Loop related optimizations\22 \\\\\0A  peephole\\t\22Peephole postpass\22 \\\\\0A  precomp\\t\22Precompile all methods before executing Main\22 \\\\\0A  sched\\t\22Instruction scheduling\22 \\\\\0A  shared\\t\22Emit per-domain code\22 \\\\\0A  sse2\\t\22SSE2 instructions on x86 [arch-dependency]\22 \\\\\0A  tailc\\t\22Tail recursion and tail calls\22 \\\\\0A  transport\\t\22Specify the transport that the debugger will use to communicate\22)' \\\0A    -f -d 'Use optimizations'\0A\0Acomplete -c mono -l response -d 'Use a response file'\0Acomplete -c mono -l runtime -a '(mono --version)' -f -d 'Use Mono version'\0Acomplete -c mono -l server -d 'Optimize the virtual machine to be better suited for server operations'\0Acomplete -c mono -l use-map-jit -d 'Generate code using MAP_JIT on MacOS'\0Acomplete -c mono -l verify-all \\\0A    -d 'Verify mscorlib and assemblies in the cache for valid IL, and user code for IL verifiability'\0A\0A# Development options\0Acomplete -c mono -l debug -a '(__fish_append , \\\\\0A  casts\\t\22Produce a detailed error when throwing a InvalidCastException\22 \\\\\0A  mdb-optimizations\\t\22Disable some JIT optimizations which are usually only disabled when running inside the debugger\22 \\\\\0A  gdb\\t\22Generate and register debugging information with gdb\22)' \\\0A    -f -d 'Use the debugging mode in the runtime'\0A\0Acomplete -c mono -l profile -f -d 'Use a profiler module with the given arguments'\0Acomplete -c mono -l trace -f -d 'Show method names as they are invoked'\0Acomplete -c mono -l no-x86-stack-align -d 'Don\\'t align stack frames on the x86 architecture'\0Acomplete -c mono -l jitmap -d 'Generate a JIT method map in a /tmp/perf-PID.map file'\0A\0A# JIT maintainer options\0Acomplete -c mono -l bisect -f -d 'This flag is used by the automatic optimization bug bisector'\0Acomplete -c mono -l break -x \\\0A    -d 'Insert a breakpoint before the method whose name is \\'method\\' (namespace.class:methodname)'\0Acomplete -c mono -l breakonex -d 'Use a breakpoint on exceptions'\0Acomplete -c mono -l compile -x -d 'Compile a method (namespace.name:methodname)'\0Acomplete -c mono -l compile-all -d 'Compile all the methods in an assembly'\0Acomplete -c mono -l graph \\\0A    -a 'cfg\\t\22Control Flow Graph (CFG)\22\0A    dtree\\t\22Dominator Tree\22 code\\t\22CFG showing code\22\0A    ssa\\t\22CFG showing code after SSA translation\22\0A    optcode\\t\22CFG showing code after IR optimizations\22' \\\0A    -x -d 'Generate a postscript file with a graph with the details about the specified method'\0Acomplete -c mono -l ncompile \\\0A    -d 'Tell runtime to compile methods specified by --compile N times'\0Acomplete -c mono -l stats \\\0A    -d 'Display information about the work done by the runtime during the execution of an application'\0Acomplete -c mono -l wapi \\\0A    -a 'hps\\t\22Delete the global semaphore\22\0A    semdel\\t\22List the currently used handles\22' \\\0A    -x -d 'Perform maintenance of the process shared data'\0Acomplete -c mono -s v -l verbose -d 'Show more messages'\0A", align 1
